      "content": "but it's not just about 'moving forward'... everyone else is gone. i look at their families and i just feel like i'm stealing their time. like, every breath i take is something they can't have. it feels so selfish to just keep existing when it should've been them. it feels like a debt i can never actually pay back no matter what i do.",
